			(property "Description" "RFQ open-loop (TMR / Hall) current sensor: measuring range >= +/-500 A, I_PN >= 216 A rms (250 A continuous primary), 5 V supply, Vout = Vref + G x I with the reference on its own pin (Vref 2.5 V), G 3.5-4.0 mV/A, bandwidth >= 100 kHz, response <= 1 us, accuracy +/-2 % after calibration, primary-secondary basic for 1000 V DC + 400 V AC (OVC III), -40..105 C (pcs_spec sensing.phase_current)"
